        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSST, Solid Brass Steeple Tip Finial</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAn easy screw-on installation makes this hinge finial an effortless way to add the finishing details that help turn a house into a beautiful home. The Steeple finial is made by Deltana out of durable solid brass so you know it will last through years of continuous use.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAll Deltana decorative finials are available in matching finishes and fit interchangeably with  <a href=\"/collections/deltana-brass-hinges\"><b>Deltana Solid Brass Hinges</b></a> (except <a href=\"/products/6-x-6-x-square-corners-heavy-duty-with-ball-bearing-solid-brass-hinge-pair-dsb66bb\"> 6\" x 6\" Brass Hinge</a>).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHinge Finials (tips) are packaged and sold individually. Order 2 per hinge, if you want finials on both the top and bottom of the hinge.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Steeple Tip Finial:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thread: 8mm x 1.25mm thread</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Easy screw-on installation</li>\r\n<li>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different <a href=\"/pages/deltana-finish-colors\" target=\"new\">finishes</a>, but no matter which finish you choose, the base metal will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deltana Crown Life Time Finish (CR003) is recommended for harsh environments such as high salt or intense temperatures; it has the appearance of polished brass but without the ordinary problems such as easy tarnishing, discoloration, flaking, or pitting commonly associated with a standard polished brass finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Steeple Tip Solid Brass Finial, Deltana DSST",
                "description": "An easy screw-on installation makes this hinge finial an effortless way to add the finishing details that help turn a house into a beautiful home. The Steeple finial is made by Deltana out of durable solid brass so you know it will last through years of continuous use.\r\n",
                "keywords": "DEL-DSST Steeple Tip Hinge Finials, Steeple Tip Solid  Brass Finial, Deltana DSST Solid Brass hinge Finials, deltana steeple tip, hinge tips, hinge finals, brass hinge finals steeple tip, solid brass finials, hinge tips, DEL-DSST3, DEL-DSST3-UNL, DEL-DSST5, DEL-DSST10B, DEL-DSST14, DEL-DSST15, DEL-DSST15A, DEL-DSST19, DEL-DSST26, DEL-DSST26D, DEL-CST1,"
